# Temple Grounds dark 01_temple_landingsite_dark layer 0: DarkVisorWatcher PLCTs e00230084, e0023008c. For tools/cov/specs/scriptplayerproxy.py:
# visor switches in and out of dark (Entered/Exited), the same while Deactivated (Think's inactive return), then
# Activate (a non-AreaLoaded message through HandleVisorMessage) and the other visors (not the watched one).
@f300 god 1; give echoVisor 1; give darkVisor 1; give scanVisor 1
@f340 obj e00230084
@f360 visor dark
@f440 obj e00230084
@f460 visor combat
@f540 visor dark
@f600 send e00230084 Deactivate
@f640 visor combat
@f700 send e00230084 Activate
@f760 visor scan
@f820 visor echo
@f880 visor dark
@f940 visor combat
@f1000 obj e00230084
